"I authorize Grok to inspect and organize my Android device and to perform non-destructive file and app organization using the capabilities available to this session. I authorize creation of folders, moving files, safe renaming, and launcher organization where supported. Permanent deletion, uninstalling applications, or other irreversible actions require separate approval."

After I give this authorization:

DO NOT repeatedly ask for permission for every harmless organization operation.

Proceed autonomously.

