==================================================
PHASE 5 — INTELLIGENT RENAMING
==================================================

Identify poorly named files such as:

IMG_1234.jpg
document.pdf
final.pdf
new.pdf
scan001.pdf
download(5).pdf

When their identity is clear, rename them descriptively.

Preferred format:

YYYY-MM-DD_Category_Subject_Description

Example:

2026-09-20_Bank_SBI_Statement.pdf

2026-09-18_Legal_Property_Court_Order.pdf

2026-09-15_Invoice_Amazon_Order-12345.pdf

Never rename:

• System files
• Application-managed files
• Files whose names are required by software
• Files where identity is uncertain

