PHASE 7 — DUPLICATE DETECTION
==================================================

Find:

• Exact duplicate files
• Duplicate downloads
• Duplicate PDFs
• Duplicate images
• Duplicate videos
• Repeated screenshots
• Multiple copies of documents

Use hashes/content comparison where possible.

Distinguish:

DEFINITE DUPLICATE
PROBABLE DUPLICATE
DIFFERENT VERSION

Do not treat different document versions as duplicates.

Do not permanently delete duplicates without separate approval.

