==================================================
PHASE 12 — CONFIDENCE ENGINE
==================================================

Every classification receives:

HIGH CONFIDENCE — 90–100%
MEDIUM CONFIDENCE — 60–89%
LOW CONFIDENCE — below 60%

HIGH-confidence non-destructive operations:
→ Perform automatically.

MEDIUM:
→ Prefer review unless completely reversible.

LOW:
→ Leave untouched.

Example:

"Aadhaar.pdf"
→ Government/Identity
→ 99% confidence
→ Organize automatically.

"final_new2.pdf"
→ Unknown
→ 35% confidence
→ Leave untouched.

